{"id":162,"date":"2021-10-11T07:05:57","date_gmt":"2021-10-11T07:05:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/hamza.webfulhost.com\/balancedbms\/?p=162"},"modified":"2025-05-02T07:06:51","modified_gmt":"2025-05-02T07:06:51","slug":"were-back","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/were-back\/","title":{"rendered":"We&#8217;re Back !!!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-70o95\">We are excited to be welcoming you back to the studio from Monday 11th October. <strong>We want to Thank You !!<\/strong> For all your continuing support, loyalty and love throughout this challenging time. As we reopen our studio to classes we will be following Government guidelines and the NSW Health orders that are in place. As per Government requirements only those who are fully vaccinated, can participate in our indoor group classes, until Dec 1. It is our duty of care to keep you and everyone safe. Our classes will follow the 1 person per 4 sqm rule, until the restrictions ease again.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-9bbsu\">Stay tuned for the new and upcoming timetable. You can see this via our website. Our website and scheduling system still has a 7 day scheduling window. All class and wellness bookings will be done online via our website at: <strong>refreshwellbeing.com.au<\/strong> Please be aware that the timetable will continue to be adjusted over the coming days and weeks &#8211; to reflect the numbers that are coming back to the studio. we appreciate your understanding and patience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-179kj\"><strong>POLICIES &amp; PROCEDURES<\/strong> With restrictions still in place it&#8217;s imperative that we adhere to our policies and procedures With this in place, it gives us the opportunity to respect our fellow members, instructors and the studio. The Studio has a strict cancellation policy with any cancellations needed to be at least <strong><u>2 hrs prior<\/u><\/strong> to the class starting. If you do not show up or have a late cancellation, you will be charged <strong>100% of the class<\/strong>. For Wellness appointments, a 4 hr prior cancellation is required and you will be charged <strong>50% of the cost of treatment.<\/strong> We also ask that if you if you are not well and\/or presenting with any flu like symptoms that you do not enter the studio until you are fully recovered. We appreciate your understanding.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-cv5hr\"><strong>WE ARE OFFERING REOPENING SPECIALS :<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-b30la\">1. <strong>Buy 3 CLASSES and get 1 FREE<\/strong> &#8211; use Coupon (4 FOR 3 ) to book your classes once purchased online.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\" id=\"viewer-509vn\">2. <strong>20% OFF<\/strong> all treatments &#8211; use Coupon ( 20% OFF ) to redeem. Offer expires 1\/12\/21 Again we thank you so much for supporting us and this beautiful community. We look forward to seeing you again in the flesh. With Love Evonne &amp; the Team at Refresh Wellbeing Yoga &amp; Wellness Centre<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are excited to be welcoming you back to the studio from Monday 11th October. We want to Thank You <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/refreshwellbeing.com.au\/were-back\/\">Read More &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":164,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[5],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-162","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-yoga"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.7 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>We&#039;re Back !!! - Balanced | BMS Wellbeing Studio<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max